<title>DENMARK: Danish Q4 1996 industrial sales up 5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Q4 1996 industrial sales up 5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish industrial sales rose by a preliminary five percent in current prices in 1996's fourth quarter compared to the same 1995 period, the national statistics bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>The data also showed that Danish industrial sales in 1996 were up two percent on whole year 1995.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-966950</p>
</text>
